This directory holds the exemplar research and the tools that read it, not design rounds.

What lives here: the captured exemplar JSON, MEASUREMENTS.md (regenerated, never
hand-edited), NARRATIVE.md (the human read of the group), exemplars.json (the roster),
_dropped/ (captures excluded on purpose, with the reason in the roster), and
type-specimen.html, which sets the same headline in five free faces so the founder can
compare them on his own copy.

type-specimen.html can never satisfy the design chain and should not try: it has no brief,
no three directions, no buyer to comprehend it and no artifact to prove. It is a ruler, not
a page.

A round lives in site/design/<date>/ and is recognised by holding brief.md. This marker is
refused in any directory that does, so it cannot be used to switch the chain off.
